WEBVTT

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.360
Are you...

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.440
Is this your first time coming here?

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.500
No.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.250
Perhaps that's why. We may have met before.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.350
That's the feeling I get.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:23.280
You know, I was apparently 
asleep for a long time.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.370
I just couldn't wake up no matter what.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.090
You... were?

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.140
Being alive is strange, isn't it?

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.540
Despite that, I finally did wake up,

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.540
and now I'm seeing this view for myself.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.100
Doesn't it make you feel like the world 
is just one miracle after another?

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:44.290
Huh?

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:49.880
I started to feel hungry, 
so I headed out to buy food,

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.600
and then I thought the cool air felt nice,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.830
so I came over here...

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.450
and found you sitting here.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.420
When you think about it that way,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:06.690
doesn't seem like a miraculous 
coincidence that we're talking like this?

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:11.310
Almost as if someone's directing 
things to turn out this way...

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.090
Kuon...

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.820
Huh?

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.600
Do you know a girl named Kuon?

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.300
No.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:28.940
I see.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:30.870
But...

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.200
It's a nice name.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.850
I think it's a beautiful name.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:59.010
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.800
The Two Princeps

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:27.250
Anna...

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:32.990
If you weren't a mage, what 
would you have wanted to be?

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:35.850
Huh? What brought this on?

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:39.680
Well... you're good at sewing and cooking,

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.520
and you get such good grades, too...

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.820
Well, I suppose I never gave it much thought.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:51.650
I believe that I was destined to be 
a mage from the moment I was born.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.880
It's finished.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.110
Can you really do it?

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:01.540
Even without magic, I should be able 
to move this with a simple technique.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.690
I made... a doll?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.780
<b>Mangetsu-chan 
</b>Where are you?

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.700
<b>Mangetsu-chan 
</b>The sky is really pretty right now.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.430
Mangetsu...

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.590
Kohinata Mangetsu

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.060
Mangetsu?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.790
<i>Shingetsu-chan?</i>

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.310
<i>It feels like it's been ages.</i>

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:52.380
<i>Sorry I haven't been in touch.</i>

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.770
Where are you now?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.140
I'm near your house.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.930
I just ate dinner by myself.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.700
<i>Thank goodness...</i>

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.290
I know I made you worry.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.240
I'm sorry.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.180
Don't apologize to me.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.980
I should be the one apologizing.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.940
If only I were a little stronger...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.210
<i>I would never have been born?</i>

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:23.270
<i>Do you think maybe I shouldn't 
have been born at all?</i>

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:29.770
<i>Would you have been happier 
if I wasn't around?</i>

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:44.320
<i>I wanted to make a doll.</i>

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.160
<i>Somewhere deep inside me,</i>

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.520
<i>I wished for that as I ran 
away from Anna's house.</i>

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:54.100
<i>I thought, if I had magic, could 
I make this doll prettier?</i>

00:05:54.710 --> 00:06:00.750
<i>Could I make it move, talk... 
even have a heart?</i>

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:06.530
<i>When I caught myself wondering 
that, I thought, clearly...</i>

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.250
<i>"I wish magical power didn't even exist."</i>

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.170
<i>That power changes people.</i>

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.360
<i>It makes possible things 
that shouldn't be permitted.</i>

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.410
<i>So I made the decision</i>

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.770
<i>to rid this world of magic.</i>

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:28.310
<i>I thought my mind was made up,</i>

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.730
<i>but I also thought...</i>

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:35.950
<i>If I could win GRANBELM... If I could 
become the Princeps mage...</i>

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.420
<i>then maybe I could create someone like you.</i>

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.440
<i>I thought I could create</i>

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.960
<i>someone who would stay by my side,</i>

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.550
<i>someone who would comfort me...</i>

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:50.570
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.570
<i>If I were stronger, Magiaconatus 
wouldn't have reacted to me.</i>

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:55.770
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.180
<i>If I hadn't dreamed of something 
that didn't exist...</i>

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.310
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.680
Mangetsu!

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.530
Shingetsu-chan.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.350
I'm sorry.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.210
Thank you.

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:27.960
Thank you.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.410
Mangetsu...

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:36.880
It may be true that the weakness 
in your heart gave birth to me.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:40.980
Maybe I'm not something that's good for you.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.040
But I finally realized something.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.320
It's not true that I have nothing.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:56.640
When I was eating earlier, 
some of my classmates came by.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.080
But since my existence is so unstable,

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.800
none of them noticed me.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.800
Even though I sat right beside them...

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.900
It was like I was a ghost.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.420
But then, one of them said...

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:17.900
By the way, you said there was a girl in 
your class who made lunches for you, right?

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.800
Lunches?

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.550
Didn't you mention it before?

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.070
That a girl in your class made 
lunches for you all the time?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:30.860
Oh!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.370
Mangetsu-chan!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.330
Yeah, that's it!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:37.420
What, she's in your class, 
but you forgot about her?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:40.570
No, it's not that... It's just...

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:44.470
I haven't seen much of her lately, I guess...

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:55.130
She couldn't see me... She didn't 
know I was there, but she smiled.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:59.810
And Shisui-san doesn't even 
remember Kuon-chan, but she said,

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.270
"That's a nice name."

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:07.630
We won't go away. We won't really go away.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.030
I realized that.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:17.700
This pork cutlet bun is so good!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.020
Go on, Shingetsu-chan, try it!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.990
Don't you think delicious things are amazing?

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:32.870
Things that taste good, things 
that feel warm when you wear them,

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:36.440
a breeze that feels nice, a summer 
that makes you feel hot...

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:42.650
When I really thought about it, I realized 
how amazing it is to be able to feel all that.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:48.520
And also feeling happy, 
feeling sad, feeling angry...

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.500
And feeling sleepy...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.360
Those are all sort of amazing, too.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:10:00.060
Having feelings, reacting unconsciously 
when you think about something...

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.150
I think just that alone is amazing.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.940
It makes me think, "So this is
 what it means to be alive."

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:11.130
Eating pork cutlet buns until 
you feel full is amazing!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.000
Oh, it's not because I'm a doll.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.770
I really just feel that way.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.130
And I realized that what 
you said wasn't wrong.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.100
What I said?

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.150
Yeah.

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.700
That it'd be better if magic didn't exist.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:31.340
More people would realize these 
things if that power didn't exist.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.390
That even if it looks like there's nothing,

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:36.490
there are all kinds of wonderful 
things in this world!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.830
Win GRANBELM, okay?

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:46.040
And rid this world of all magic.

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.710
That's what I want you to do.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.780
Did you look at the sky?

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:00.280
The stars are beautiful.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.580
The full moon is gone, and 
the new moon is coming.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.490
When the bright, white light that 
illuminated the night sky is gone,

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:10.600
it feels like deep darkness is setting in,

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.560
but it's not.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:14.110
There are stars.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.620
Stars you can only see during a new moon.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.500
Stars you can't see during a full moon.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.990
So even when the full moon is 
gone, everything will be fine.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.460
Mangetsu...

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.710
Sorry for rambling on like that.

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.820
Are you okay out here by yourself?

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:38.630
Aren't you cold? Here, take this.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.570
Thank you...

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.840
The air feels nice, doesn't it?

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:02.990
Huh?

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.030
That's rather out of the blue, isn't it?

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.380
We don't have much time 
until the next full moon.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.500
Don't you need to prepare for battle?

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:11.850
It'll be fine.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.210
I know Shingetsu-chan will win.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.450
So this was your idea?

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.210
Yeah. Can we?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.210
We can invite Kibou and 
Kuon-chan's sister, too.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:22.920
Kuon?

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.680
Oh, right...

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.260
Don't worry about it.

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:29.480
You can count me out.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.050
I have other things to do.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:31.980
What?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.420
Nene-nee...

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.160
She says she's in.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.620
Hey! Who said you could—

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:39.430
Are the others still aware of you?

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:41.940
Should we use that technique 
on you, just in case?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.880
Here it is.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.790
What's Nene-nee up to? Is she 
starting on something again?

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.790
She's working on that laptop with 
an unreadable expression again.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.070
Investigating again?

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.050
Shut up.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.340
Why not respect their wishes?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:07.000
They must have agonized 
a lot over this decision.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:10.680
I believe choosing one thing 
means giving up on another.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.180
Is giving up the only option?

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.170
That's what happened with Mom, remember?

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:19.800
Things don't work out the 
way you hope they will.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:22.100
Isn't that what it means to be a mage?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.830
Look, look! It's so pretty!

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.370
It really is.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.710
Your expression hasn't changed at all.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:37.260
I think she's actually pretty impressed.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.710
A-Aren't we there yet?!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.230
Why are you standing over there?

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.410
Shut up!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.920
Nene-nee doesn't like high places.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.060
Oh, so that's why her ARMANOX doesn't fly—

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.200
Mangetsu.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.140
Oh, yeah. Sorry.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.660
ARMANOX?

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:57.380
D-Don't mind her. She's just a little weird.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.200
Thank you.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:13.620
Sure.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:14.790
Here you go.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:17.830
Um...

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:22.280
Thank you for inviting me along today.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:25.500
I'm Nene-chan's friend, Kohinata Kibou.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:28.300
I just realized I hadn't introduced myself.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.060
Oh, are you mad?

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.260
I did treat you like a stranger last time...

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.170
Mangetsu...

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.690
It's okay.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.880
I should thank you for coming with us.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.400
It's nice to meet you. I'm Kohinata...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.970
I mean... I'm Mangetsu.

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.980
I've known Nene-chan for a long time.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.120
She's sort of a comrade-in-arms.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.180
Comrade-in-arms?

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.410
Oh, that's right!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.920
I made lunch!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.840
Doesn't that defeat the purpose of camping?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.130
And it tastes so normal.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:10.930
You're eating it!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.730
It's pointless if we don't all eat together.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.800
Oh, right.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.470
Let's cook our meal together.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:18.940
Okay.

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.400
Nene-chan, you can make fried rice.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.310
Why?!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:24.310
Because I like it!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.510
Shingetsu-chan, where are you going?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.280
Um... Nowhere.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.660
Come cook with us, Shingetsu-chan!

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:35.870
N-No... I, um...

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.990
Shingetsu-chan, do you...

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.970
...not know how to cook?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:47.550
No! I just haven't used this 
kind of knife very much!

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.300
Sorry...

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:53.480
She's so good at using magic,

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.690
but she's surprisingly inept at normal stuff.

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.090
That might be pretty common, actually.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.770
I've lit the fire.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.480
Too big!

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.350
You're good at that.

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.360
It's easy once you get used to it.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:14.700
If I can do it, I'm sure you can do it, too.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.850
I'll take the chopped veggies over to them.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:18.770
Sure.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.790
Anna was skilled with her hands, too.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.460
She was good at everything, 
and she was smart.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.570
I see.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:38.280
Other than my abilities 
as a mage, I have nothing.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:39.890
And yet...

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.200
There's no such thing as 
someone who has nothing.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:55.010
You taught me that.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.770
Kibou-chan, could you teach 
Shingetsu-chan how to cut these?

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.480
Huh?

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.700
Thanks!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.420
Does she have something else she has to do?

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.520
Um... Um...

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.880
What was her name, again?

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.820
Thank you very much.

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:38.470
I wrote this song while I was wondering 
what it would be like to have a little sister.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.710
I guess it'll never be completely gone,

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.930
no matter how much anyone 
tries to erase it with magic.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:49.390
Here they go, all at once!

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.760
I wanna do it, too!

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.910
Come join us, Shingetsu-chan!

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.100
Are you sure about this?

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:04.300
I figured you'd try to save Mangetsu.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.410
Save her?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.040
Is getting rid of magic 
that important to you?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.190
If you become the Princeps 
mage and use magical power,

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:16.210
you could probably save her.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.700
What do you mean?

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:21.970
What? She didn't tell you?

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:25.240
I told Mangetsu that if she talked to you,

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:29.640
you could probably save her 
once you became the Princeps—

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.450
Hey!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.660
<b>Bye-bye</b>

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.300
Wait, what were we just doing?

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.640
Fireworks, right?

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.650
Oh, yeah!

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:08.100
We should start cleaning up.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.650
All right, let's do it.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.980
Shingetsu-san?

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.980
Mangetsu! Mangetsu!

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.520
Mangetsu! Mangetsu!

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:29.800
Mangetsu!

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:41.420
I should've known that wouldn't 
work on you, Shingetsu-chan.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:51.590
I asked Nene-chan and her sisters 
to stop using their technique on me,

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:54.870
because I didn't want it 
to be too hard on them.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.980
Isn't all this beautiful?

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.790
The sky, the city, the air, the ground...

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.130
Everything is so beautiful.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:11.490
You know, I'm just glad 
I was able to see this.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:15.050
I may be a doll, but I'm 
glad I got to stand here.

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:18.270
Why didn't you tell me?

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:21.990
As long as there's magic,

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:27.550
if I become the Princeps mage 
and use it on you, you could—

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:31.310
Because if you did that, 
magic wouldn't go away.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:37.780
I'm a doll that was made when 
magic reacted to your wish.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.320
I can't exist unless someone's using magic.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.950
And that means magical 
power wouldn't go away.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:50.130
That may be so... but...

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:53.570
If I'd told you, you'd lose your resolve.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:56.020
You'd give it serious thought.

00:22:00.780 --> 00:22:02.360
You can't lose your resolve.

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:07.720
You have to get rid of all magical 
power and come back here.

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:13.020
Then you'll see that the world 
looks even more beautiful.

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:16.840
The world you wished for is waiting.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.490
But you'll...

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:23.220
I'll be seeing it with you.

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:26.410
You might not be able to see me anymore...

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
But I am your heart, Shingetsu-chan.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:39.280
I'll say it one more time to 
make sure you don't forget.

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:42.840
Eliminate all magic.

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:14.870
All the magical power in the world, 
the sealed Magiaconatus...

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:18.790
Call forth the mages to this land.

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:21.370
Call forth the crystal of human wisdom.

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:24.090
Call forth all the magic that has been lost.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:28.460
With your power, summon all of us into you!

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:46.980
It's time for the test.

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:51.430
You who strive to become the Princeps mage...

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:54.490
Welcome to the stage of the gods.

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.750
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:57.910 --> 00:24:02.580
<i>At last, Mangetsu and Shingetsu step 
onto the field of the final battle.</i>

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:06.040
<i>Awaiting them is a girl possessed by magic</i>

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:08.650
<i>who has longed to become a mage.</i>

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:13.170
<i>In this world where all magical 
power and all passion intersect,</i>

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:16.930
<i>the girls' emotional ecstasy comes to a boil.</i>

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:19.560
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.810
<b>Magiaconatus</b>

00:24:19.710 --> 00:24:21.550
<i>"Magiaconatus."</i>

00:24:22.180 --> 00:24:26.260
<i>Shout, scream, and fall, young girls!</i>

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.030
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
